ia-inverse/85 to-inverse/40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-inverse/70 via-transparent to-transparent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-accent/10 mix-blend-color\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"container py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-24\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"no-print\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 text-xs text-on-inverse/70\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"hover:text-on-inverse\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-on-inverse/40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><a class=\"hover:text-on-inverse\" href=\"/restaurant\">Tools</a></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right h-3.5 w-3.5 text-on-inverse/40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span aria-current=\"page\" class=\"font-medium text-on-inverse\">Guides</span></li></ol></nav><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3001/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3001/restaurant\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Guides\",\"item\":\"http://localhost:3001/restaurant/guides\"}]}</script><div class=\"mt-6 max-w-3xl text-on-inverse\"><p class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-on-inverse/20 bg-on-inverse/10 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent-bright backdrop-blur\">Learn the numbers</p><h1 class=\"mt-5 text-[2.2rem] font-semibold leading-[1.06] text-on-inverse sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem]\"><span class=\"text-accent-bright\">Restaurant finance</span> <span class=\"font-serif font-normal italic\">guides</span></h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-on-inverse/80 sm:text-lg\">The key idea behind each calculator in two minutes, with a worked example you can check yourself.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"container pb-16 pt-12\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Menu Pricing</h2></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A way to set delivery-app prices from your real cost per order instead of copying competitors or guessing.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><b>Why it matters:</b> <!-- -->Dine-in prices copied onto delivery apps often lose money once discounts, commission, GST and ads are taken out. Pricing from cost fixes that.</p><p class=\"tabular mt-3 rounded-xl bg-wash p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><b>Example:</b> <!-- -->Dish ₹100 + Labour ₹15 + Packaging ₹15 = ₹130. With 10% discount, 25% commission and 5% ads, factor = 0.9 × (1 − 0.05 − 1.18 × 0.25) = 0.5895. Break-even = ₹130 ÷ 0.5895 = ₹220.53. For a 20% margin: ₹130 ÷ 0.3895 = ₹333.76. At ₹333.76 the payout is ₹196.75 and profit ₹66.75 (20%).</p><a class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-dark hover:underline\" href=\"/restaurant/menu-pricing-calculator\">Open the <!-- -->menu pricing<!-- --> calculator <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Online Payout</h2></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A breakdown of one delivery-app order from the price on the menu to the profit you keep.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><b>Why it matters:</b> <!-- -->Many owners judge delivery by the payout. The payout isn&#x27;t profit: the food, labour and packaging still have to be paid for. This view shows whether each order really makes money.</p><p class=\"tabular mt-3 rounded-xl bg-wash p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><b>Example:</b> <!-- -->₹333.76 selling price, 10% discount, 25% commission, 5% ads: discount ₹33.38, CV ₹300.38, commission ₹75.10, GST on commission ₹13.52, ads ₹15.02. Payout ₹196.75. Profit ₹196.75 − ₹130 = ₹66.75 (20%), matching the Menu Pricing example.</p><a class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-dark hover:underline\" href=\"/restaurant/online-sale-payout-calculator\">Open the <!-- -->online payout<!-- --> calculator <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-soft text-accent-dark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-grid h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"14\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"7\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Menu Engineering</h2></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">A way to sort every dish by how well it sells and how much it earns per unit after platform deductions.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><b>Why it matters:</b> <!-- -->It shows which dishes deserve the best spots on your menu and in your ads, and which ones only keep the kitchen busy.</p><p class=\"tabular mt-3 rounded-xl bg-wash p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"><b>Example:</b> <!-- -->A biryani selling 640 units with profit per unit above the menu average is a Star. A tandoori platter with high profit per unit but only 85 units sold is a Puzzle to promote.</p><a class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-dark hover:underline\" href=\"/restaurant/menu-engineering-calculator\">Open the <!-- -->menu engineering<!-- --> calculator <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></article></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"no-print mt-20 border-t border-line bg-card\"><div class=\"container grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div class=\"max-w-sm\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink\" aria-label=\"KitchenMath home\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-inverse text-sm font-bold text-accent-bright\">₹</span><span class=\"text-[17px]\">KitchenMath</span></a><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted\">Free calculators that help restaurant owners price dishes for profit, check online-order payouts and find their most profitable dishes.</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-light\">Results are estimates based on the numbers you enter. Benchmarks are indicative. Nothing here is financial, tax or legal advice.</p></div><nav aria-label=\"Calculators\"><p class=\"eyebrow mb-3\">Calculators</p><ul class=\"grid gap-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-ink-soft hover:text-accent-dark\" href=\"/restaurant/menu-pricing-calculator\">Menu Pricing</a></li><li><a class=\"text-ink-soft hover:text-accent-dark\" href=\"/res